  "note": "Election of the Newry Urban District Council, polled Friday 15 January 1926 (Newry Reporter, 19 January 1926, p. 3). All six Unionists returned, including Labour Unionist Littlewood. The Newry Reporter misprints Connor 678 and Boland 319; the Belfast News-Letter, 18 January 1926, p. 7, prints 628 and 619, which reconcile with the poll (Boland and Littlewood tie on 619). Figures follow the News-Letter."
